From 2160dfa2e7522de79dc0b593fdc0f2910945a7b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:55:15 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(issues): show a sub-issue's parent on board cards and
 list rows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A chip with the parent's identifier and title (tooltip: Sub-issue of …) next
to the identifier, so children are told apart from top-level issues at a
glance. Parents keep their sub-issue progress ring.

Patch-Id: parent-child
